<header><p class="enc-kicker">Religion / idea · ideology</p><h1 class="enc-title">Conservatism</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 1790 CE – present</span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Conservatism is a philosophy and ideology that seeks to preserve traditional institutions, customs and values, founded as a modern tradition by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/edmund-burke">Edmund Burke</a> in his opposition to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-revolution">French Revolution</a>.</p></div>
